      "challenges": [
        "2,688 alerts; 1,556 verified (57.9%), 425 validated suspects, 407 investigated (95.8%), and 213 transferred. Six provinces have numeric alert rows (Haut-Uele, Bas-Uele, Ituri, Nord-Kivu, Sud-Ubangi and Tshopo); Sud-Kivu is unavailable, not zero.",
        "Nord-Kivu prints 360 hospitalised patients, 256 of them in normed structures, and 72.3% occupancy without a bed count. 72.3% is 256/354 against the 354 beds SR135 last printed, so it counts only patients in normed structures; on the comparable all-patient basis 360/354 would be 101.7%. With no bed count in this edition the rate is withheld as a conflict. 104 patients (28.9%) are outside normed structures.",
