        "PoE/PoC completeness is 96/99 (97.0%). Of six PoE/PoC alerts, one live alert at the Mabakese PoC (Mambasa), a traveller from Beni, was validated and transferred to the Mambasa CTE; a body intercepted at the Foner Mambasa PoC was swabbed, result pending, and the other four alerts were invalidated.",
        "Ituri ring opening is 23/41 (56.1%); further bodies were not swabbed for lack of supplies and teams at Mandima or after family refusals. Nord-Kivu household decontamination is 5/27 (18.5%).",
        "Ituri ran out of ERVEBO vaccine, temporarily stopping vaccination and research activities there."
